WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.011 --> 00:00:06.276
Open Reminders in More

2
00:00:06.276 --> 00:00:10.253
Tap plus and choose a time

3
00:00:10.253 --> 00:00:22.000
Tap the weekdays to repeat on

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
