5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Select every weekday for a daily reminder

6
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Add more times and toggle each reminder separately

7
00:00:44.000 --> 00:01:08.400
iCloud syncs only times and weekdays. Notification switches stay on each device
